  "name": "Workflow_D_FX",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow D: Human review\nNEEDS_REVIEW → create review case → dashboard evidence → reviewer decision → update case → retry or close.\n\nDashboard waits, then POST to the Wait webhook:\n```json\n{\n  \"decision\": \"RETRY\",\n  \"reviewer\": \"ops\",\n  \"comment\": \"note\"\n}\n```\nDecisions: CONFIRM_OK | CONFIRM_MISMATCH | RETRY | CLOSE",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 420
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -160,
        -80
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "07e22a63-5a75-4a36-8a21-e98c1c3dbf5b",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
